      <header>
        <div class="report-header-row"><div>
          <div class="eyebrow">YOLO video benchmark</div>
          <h1>${title}</h1>
        </div><a class="back-link top-back-link" href="${back_href}index.html">Back to YOLO report index</a></div>
        <div class="report-meta-row"><p>${meta_html}</p>${overall_result}</div>
        <p>${timed_region} | ${frame_count} frames | ${resolution} @ ${source_fps} source FPS | imgsz ${imgsz} | ${device} | ${run_count} runs</p>
      </header>
      <section class="report-section" id="information">
        <div class="report-section-heading"><h2>Measurement</h2></div>
        <section class="section-card">
          <p>The pinned MP4 is processed unpaced. FPS includes decode, color conversion, inference, post-processing, result serialization, and delivery. The first frame is warmup.</p>
          <p>Bare model: <code>${bare_model}</code><br>PEK OpChain: <code>${pek_opchain}</code></p>
          <p>Video SHA-256: <code>${video_sha256}</code> | <a href="video-source.json">source manifest</a>${summary_links}</p>
        </section>
      </section>
      <section class="report-section" id="summary">
        <div class="report-section-heading"><h2>Median throughput</h2></div>
        <section class="section-card">${summary_table}</section>
      </section>
      <section class="report-section" id="runs">
        <div class="report-section-heading"><h2>Runs</h2></div>
        <section class="section-card">${runs_table}</section>
      </section>
      <a class="back-link" href="${back_href}index.html">Back to YOLO report index</a>
